Duplicate file arguments warn before the command file is created, so the
warning is buffered into the command window.

-- args --
-R a a
-- a --
hello
-- proto --
Hversion 2
Hnewname tag=0
Hmovname tag=0 "a"
Hnewname tag=1
Hmovname tag=1 "a"
Tversion 2
Tstartcmdfile
Hnewname tag=2
Hbindname tag=2
Hcurrent tag=2
Hmovname tag=2 "~~sam~~"
Hgrow tag=2 p=0 n=34
Hcheck0 tag=2
Hack
Trequest 2 0 34
Hdata tag=2 p=0 "?warning: duplicate file name `a'\n"
Tack
Hunlock
Texit
